Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:39.43,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.32,0:29:38.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（内有病人 让他们死）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.53,0:30:22.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（别来找我们）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.20,0:30:56.55,Title,0,0,0,0,,（赫伯特·乔治·威尔斯 《未来的模样》）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.07,0:00:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头发有点脏乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting a little messy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.61,0:00:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting ready for retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.01,0:00:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用遵守仪容规定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relaxing the grooming standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去当个水管工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking about becoming a plumber,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,牧羊人什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a sheepherder, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在可不是在牧羊 亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't herding sheep now, Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞清楚状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes on the prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.59,0:00:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,太对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我的好姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我会让你刮掉我全身的毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll let you shave me down all over,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.99,0:00:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,像海豚一样光溜溜\N{\fnArial\fs30}dolphin-smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚帮你刮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cut it for you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.19,0:00:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许罗西塔也可以帮你修剪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, maybe Rosita can give you a trim while she's at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背后的头发有点长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Party's getting a little long in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫非这是你力量的源泉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is it your source of power?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.11,0:01:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近不会屠杀狮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't slaying a lion anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会打赌说我自己会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be placing any wagers on seeing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,用一块驴腮骨杀掉一千个非利士人\N{\fnArial\fs30}dispatch a thousand Philistines with the jawbone of an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就只打算拯救世界 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so you'll just settle on saving the world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.59,0:01:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是昨晚的事吗？- 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Last night? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 昨晚和明天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that and tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想那个牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm thinking about that preacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.20,0:01:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们就在我们后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're just behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许达里尔和卡萝尔回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Daryl and Carol came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们拿了地图 找到了车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they took the map, found some cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're just down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.05,0:01:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会赶上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在为他们开道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're clearing the way for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.53,0:01:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,多长时间才能奏效？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.82,0:02:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你到达终端 做你该做的事后？\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you get on that terminal and do what you have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,取决于许多因素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on a number of factors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.34,0:02:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括世界范围内标靶位置附近的感染密度\N{\fnArial\fs30}including density of the infected around target sites worldwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 标靶位置？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, target sites?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说导弹吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you talking about missiles?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是机密内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你不再保密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.55,0:02:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们都活下去了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we all live?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候秘密就重要了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The secrets will matter then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.29,0:02:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 一切恢复正常的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, the speed with which things normalize.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,取决于很多因素\N{\fnArial\fs30}depend on a number of factors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.83,0:02:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括全球气候模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}including worldwide weather patterns,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此的建模并没有假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}which were modeled without the assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.01,0:02:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车 飞机 船只和火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}that cars, planes, boats, and trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.28,0:02:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,会这么长时间不向大气中排放碳氢化合物\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't be pouring hydrocarbons into the atmosphere this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让通过空气传播的病原体充满了变数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changed the game quite a bit when it comes to air-transmissible pathogens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.53,0:02:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么留这个发型？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.91,0:02:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不许任何人剪我的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one is takin' scissor or clipper to it anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗 埃斯皮诺萨小姐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me, Miss Espinoza?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.13,0:02:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 听得很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.71,0:02:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以随便笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all can laugh all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:03:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人在取笑你啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one was making fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.50,0:03:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇见的最聪明的人碰巧喜欢我的发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}The smartest man I ever met happened to love my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.47,0:03:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前的老板 布鲁克斯·埃利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old boss, T. Brooks Ellis,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.11,0:03:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类基因组计划的主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}the director of the Human Genome Project.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.49,0:03:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我的发型让我看起来像是 我引用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said my hair made me look like, and I quote,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,「一个有趣的人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A fun guy, "
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只不过不是参孙而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just ain't Samson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.35,0:05:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.53,0:05:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个传教士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The preacher…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't see another way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hold on, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人呢 都没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone else, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 引擎着火了 我们得赶快离开 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The engine's on fire. We gotta get out of here. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我俩先走 把它们击退\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you and I go first, knock them back,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.69,0:05:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,给玛姬和罗西塔开路\N{\fnArial\fs30}clear the way for Maggie and Rosita to get out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们一起解决它们 行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we all start hitting them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行 - 好的 我们会活着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - All right. We'll do it live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塔拉？ - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tara? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你掩护尤金 等安全了再出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cover Eugene. You come out when it's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.17,0:06:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 等我信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - On my go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我知道这可怖之极\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I know it sucks and it's scary,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.36,0:06:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你必须鼓起勇气 - 这不是我能控制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but it's time to be brave. - It isn't voluntary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能的 不然你只有死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, when you're screwed either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须抉择 拯救他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you cut through the choice that might help somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在你身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.09,0:07:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看尤金有没有受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check Eugene, see if he's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.51,0:08:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 就一点擦伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. Just cuts and dings is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你的血吗？- 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that your blood? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤口又裂开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn thing opened again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 伤口非常小\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, the cuts are finer than frog's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是容易流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just big bleeders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,急救箱在巴士里\N{\fnArial\fs30}First aid kit's in the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看有什么能用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能停下 必须继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not stopping. We're rolling on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.86,0:08:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在路上再找一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find another vehicle down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.26,0:08:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mission hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唱句反调 没别的意思…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil's advocate, nothing more…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出了严重的车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}we smashed to a stop hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且路上一直在挪开障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}We spent a lot of time rolling things out of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里离教堂只有15英里… - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The church is just 15 miles back that way… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能停下 也不走回头路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't stop. We don't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是战争 撤退就是战败\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at war, and retreat means we lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,道路险阻 计划多舛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The road fights back, the plan gets jacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须克服一切 因为我们没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we will get through this because we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一步都有未知的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every direction is a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们决不后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直不能更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am fit as a damn fiddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.83,0:09:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.86,0:09:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切由你决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are calling this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我必须要确认你没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to know you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败都是这样开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how things stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在承担不起失败 世界也承担不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't afford that right now. The world can't afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 出车祸了我很受挫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I took a pretty hard shot to the sack with that crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到巴士毁了 我压力很大 也很沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am stressed and depressed to see that ride die,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果你说我们继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you say we're rolling on,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.97,0:09:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're rolling on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种伤抹点泥土 走走就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna rub some dirt on it and walk it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:09:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会像以前一样 在路上找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find what we need like we always have…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要的东西 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- on the way. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会乱抹什么泥土\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not rubbing dirt on anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们可以找些自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can find some bikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,自行车不会起火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bikes don't burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.65,0:10:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金 你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.60,0:10:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.53,0:11:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ell…?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.33,0:11:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去搜索一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take a sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:13:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.11,0:14:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}For showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽说做了点交易才把你弄来 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took a little horse trading to get you here, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我看明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's plain as potatoes to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,车祸后你本可以说明理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coulda lit out after the crash,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.40,0:14:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后离开 但你留下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}made a case, but you stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我约定过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但也可以反悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you coulda broke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又能怎么样呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚要把那东西收起来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna put that thing away tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不包起来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna wrap that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要让它透透气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm gonna let it get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚在教堂 手都刮花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got cut up pretty ugly last night back at the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.23,0:15:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,能活到现在的人都很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotten to the point where everyone alive is strong now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,强者要么与他人并肩作战 互相利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're either strong and they can help you so you help them or…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么因为太强而被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're strong and they can kill ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.39,0:15:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你必须杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you gotta kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.38,0:15:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须杀了他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta kill them and…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说杀人并非易事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to say it's never easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今最简单的事莫过于此了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the easiest thing in the world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界会改变的 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's gonna change, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're damn right it's gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better turn in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晚点还要放哨呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got late watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要先去来一发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really need some ass first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要告诉我 不过 挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't need to know that, but, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.89,0:17:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又在那儿看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's watching again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那边的自助区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there in the self-help section.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,「自助」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Self-help."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about him, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没什么危害\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.26,0:17:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经到了 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm already there. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.93,0:17:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.23,0:17:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坦白 我是在看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cards on the table, I was watching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.13,0:17:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他们知道我偶尔会看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe they know I catch an eyeful on occasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是他们的癖好 也不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which isn't to say it's their thing. It's not mine either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是因为我喜欢女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that I enjoy the female form.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.65,0:17:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这样做既不会害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I consider this a victimless crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能让我得到安慰和消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}that provides both comfort and distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许… 也许我们可以换个地方说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, uh… maybe we can move on from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.65,0:17:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚在找你 想和你道谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for you to say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:17:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在巴士那里掩护了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}for having my back at the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不算吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我真救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I did, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是因为你给我提供了机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}you provided the context for me doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 不管怎样我都死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I was screwed either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.07,0:18:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我选择拯救他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I went with the choice that helped someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.95,0:18:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这话很老套 但却发现是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it trite, but it turned out to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.52,0:18:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来就有这个力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.72,0:18:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你之前没有 现在也有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you didn't before, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我也是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm… I'm the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你自己可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到我刚刚说的话了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, did you hear what I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴士翻车都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bus crashed because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.06,0:18:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是的 - 就是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it didn't. - Yes, it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把玻璃渣放进了燃油管路里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put crushed glass in the fuel line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我之前在教堂里找到的灯泡弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light bulbs I found in the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.41,0:18:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,本应该在上路前就坏掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}should've failed before it ever got to the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点害死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would've killed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来不应该像这样坏掉的 完全不应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't supposed to go down like that, not hardly, not half.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.14,0:18:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,玻璃渣不应该弄坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The glass wasn't supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,火花塞旁边的燃油管路\N{\fnArial\fs30}wear out the fuel line next to the spark plugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.51,0:18:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们运气太差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fully pulled the short straw on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么啊？你为什么这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.06,0:19:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.05,0:19:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么… 尤金？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why did… Eugene?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.00,0:19:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.09,0:19:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.23,0:19:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赞同善意的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate the positive affirmations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,和对某些事视而不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and looking the other way on the perversion,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是根据我的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know empirically.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我绝不可能独自生存下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and definitively I cannot survive on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不行 - 所以你就弄坏了巴士吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I cannot. - So you killed the bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我不能治愈这场瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't cure the disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.16,0:19:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能拯救世界 我就毫无价值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I don't save the world, I have no value.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.48,0:19:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我不能解决这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't fix things,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.21,0:19:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们绝对不会把我带在身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no way you people would keep me around,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我分享资源 甚至是保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}share resources, even protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.86,0:19:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当然会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we would.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是朋友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.68,0:19:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要互相照应的 就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have each other's backs. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.16,0:19:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就应该是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉别人你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell anyone else what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:20:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为你保守秘密 我们会继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep your secret and we'll keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道自己搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在努力 但是 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying, but, dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能再这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't do something like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们绑在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stuck with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.37,0:20:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我们和你绑在一起一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like we're stuck with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何都是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道自己为什么会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.07,0:20:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入人类 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the human race, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.97,0:20:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 很晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想他们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thinking about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.18,0:21:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.87,0:21:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉好内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这算我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we get to have…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在书店地板上的小假期\N{\fnArial\fs30}little vacations on bookstore floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.37,0:21:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在不在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not back there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为其它的事而活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're living for something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.17,0:21:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们现在还不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they don't get to right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.98,0:21:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天差点死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did almost die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.77,0:21:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们没车\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we don't have a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得从厕所取水喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're drinking toilet water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.37,0:21:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这样的感觉依然很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just feels really good having this…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.67,0:22:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为过去不再重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it's not about what was.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.59,0:22:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚不再重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.65,0:22:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all about what's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.65,0:22:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别为此感到内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't feel guilty about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.12,0:23:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.24,0:23:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.26,0:23:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我阻止了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stopped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.22,0:23:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在不必害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be scared now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:23:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.28,0:24:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还偷偷去过护士学校吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You been going to nursing school on the sly?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.12,0:24:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是罗杰和帕姆教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger and Pam taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.87,0:24:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得今天我们应该留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should stay here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.77,0:24:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.38,0:24:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备在这里读书吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got some reading you need to catch up on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.58,0:24:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们昨天侥幸没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got lucky yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.14,0:24:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们都受伤了 特别是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're all banged up, you especially.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.50,0:24:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们经历过更糟糕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.74,0:24:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.75,0:24:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们总是被迫停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we always wind up stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.35,0:24:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我们总是没准备好就上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we never start at 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.05,0:24:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去华盛顿的路上 我们浪费的每一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every minute we waste getting him to Washington,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.48,0:24:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有人死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}people are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.74,0:24:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I don't understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.18,0:24:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历了这一切之后？\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.41,0:24:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我可是真的想让大家抵达目的地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I want us to actually get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.52,0:24:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你想让我们闲坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you want us to sit around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.59,0:24:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我们停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want us to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.41,0:24:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座城镇还不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}This town isn't in bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.99,0:25:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间书店甚至还完好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This store wasn't even touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.73,0:25:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可以成为不错的基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could make a good base here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.18,0:25:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以花最后一天时间找些补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could spend one last day doing a sweep for supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.80,0:25:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们边走边找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll sweep as we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.48,0:25:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,从休斯顿开始就是这么做的 现在不能停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've done it since Houston. We're not stopping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.89,0:25:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到女士的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们往北走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking it north.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.11,0:25:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,厕所里没水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tapped out the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.98,0:25:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,布劳德河在西边八公里的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broad River is five miles west.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.03,0:25:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到车之前 我们至少要到那里补给一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the very least, we stock up there before we find wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.42,0:25:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实有辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.35,0:25:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰巧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it just so happens…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.68,0:25:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,车上装了五百加仑水\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's got 500 gallons of water on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.89,0:26:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也该走运一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About time things started going our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.35,0:26:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.57,0:27:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不能走运一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One damn time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.85,0:27:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到别的车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find another ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.82,0:27:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果镇子里有能用的车 我们早就看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was a ride worth a shit in this town, we'd have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.22,0:27:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆车被用来撞过行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's done some crowd clearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.61,0:27:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好阻塞了进气口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right up into the intake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.31,0:27:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means we've got an.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.94,0:27:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,空气过滤器塞满了该死的尸骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}air filter filled with damn human remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.70,0:27:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界上每一个该死的小角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there is no damned corner on this damned Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.82,0:27:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,都被破坏的面目全非了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that has not been dicked hard beyond all damned recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.44,0:27:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.45,0:27:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.91,0:27:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是散热器的通风口\N{\fnArial\fs30}That feeds the radiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.25,0:27:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎的进气口在车顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The intake for the engine is actually on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.43,0:27:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara, Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.78,0:27:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不能走运一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One damn time!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.40,0:28:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就一次 - 亚伯拉罕 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One damn time! - Abraham, just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.41,0:28:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面还有更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more from the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.24,0:28:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我参加过七个乡郡庆典\N{\fnArial\fs30}I been to eight county fairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.44,0:28:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个山羊竞技比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one goat rodeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.44,0:28:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没这个让人开眼界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never seen anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.78,0:29:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,书店旁边有家慈善商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a Goodwill over there by the bookstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.31,0:29:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里残破不堪 但可能会有些补给品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty blown up, but there might be some supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.46,0:29:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些干燥的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}some dry clothes, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.22,0:29:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.16,0:29:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我两三下就能清理好进气口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can clear that intake in two shakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.80,0:29:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后引擎就能吸入空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the engine will get some wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.33,0:29:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也就能兜风了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so will we.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.35,0:29:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会吹干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll air-dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.33,0:29:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We roll on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.82,0:29:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.45,0:29:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,太扯淡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shit is screwed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.01,0:30:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,AJ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}AJ?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.88,0:30:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becca?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.38,0:30:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.98,0:30:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.88,0:31:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么留这个发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why you have the haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.56,0:31:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 因为我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, it's 'cause I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.29,0:31:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 我也很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that. I like it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.77,0:31:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你喜欢是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you like it for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.51,0:31:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是别人以为的那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the person people think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.98,0:31:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想向他们展示真实的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want 'em to know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.54,0:31:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不懂你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not following you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.09,0:31:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不留这种长发\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you didn't have that mullet,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.69,0:31:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就和其他科学家一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd probably be like everybody else in the labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.02,0:31:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你跟别人不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not like everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.98,0:31:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果别人处在你的位置上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think a lot of people in your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.54,0:31:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能早就放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably woulda given up,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.19,0:31:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.89,0:31:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这一路上… 有很多人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were people… a lot of them along the way…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.09,0:31:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们确保了我不放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}they made sure I didn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.88,0:31:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不是我的功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't me remotely.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.27,0:32:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.50,0:32:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都多亏了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You started this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.47,0:32:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和参孙不一样 他头脑不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not like Samson. He was kind of a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.88,0:32:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不懂你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not following you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.53,0:32:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的故事是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, his story goes…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.12,0:32:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天一只狮子袭击了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that one day when a lion attacked him,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.00,0:32:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝给了他力量 将狮子撕成两半\N{\fnArial\fs30}God gave him strength and he tore it apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.19,0:32:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后他又独自回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he goes back one day, he's by himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.58,0:32:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到蜜蜂在遗骸上造了蜂窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he sees that bees have made a hive in the carcass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.30,0:32:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他就把这个谜语讲给世人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So later he tells this riddle to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.83,0:32:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「吃的从吃者出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Out of the eater, something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.01,0:32:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜的从强者出来「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the strong, something sweet."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.65,0:32:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I always thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.30,0:32:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是关于他自己的生活经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How the hell are people supposed to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.78,0:32:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人怎么能猜得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}the answer when it's just about his own life?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.07,0:32:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案只在他自己的脑袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the only place the answer is is in his own head?"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.09,0:32:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么味道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, what the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.34,0:32:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.22,0:32:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,起风了 你马上就能闻到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wind's picking up. You're about to smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.55,0:32:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.73,0:32:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么在发臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's making that stench,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.26,0:33:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不是什么好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}it ain't nothing nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.90,0:33:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.82,0:33:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经停下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we're stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.86,0:34:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.80,0:34:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会投降的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I will not lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.13,0:34:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.98,0:34:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会屈服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not abase.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.46,0:34:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕 咱们离开这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.39,0:34:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会认输的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not give up the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.25,0:34:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.11,0:34:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该走了 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta go. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.38,0:34:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.81,0:34:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们听不见也看不见咱们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't hear us and they can't see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.18,0:34:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,离得很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.35,0:34:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.82,0:34:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这就是所谓的没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is the definition of "Fine."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.98,0:34:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要地图 肯定有路能绕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need the map. There's gotta be a detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.71,0:34:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.81,0:34:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从休斯顿到乔治亚一路都在绕道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We detoured and detoured and detoured from Houston to Georgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.32,0:34:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不这么干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not playing that game anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.57,0:34:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没法直接这么穿过去好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not going through this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.84,0:34:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.86,0:34:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,A门后面是狂风暴雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a shitstorm behind door A.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.39,0:34:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,B门后面是暴雨狂风\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a storm of shit behind door B.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.51,0:34:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果够幸运 顶多碰到行尸或者卡车被击毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're lucky, it's walkers or a shot-up truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.25,0:35:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但早晚会被逼入绝境\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sooner or later you get cornered.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.53,0:35:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能待在原地 最后自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wind up staying and you wind up killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.62,0:35:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会回头 也不能回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't go back. We can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.17,0:35:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说要回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.59,0:35:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是往南走几里 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just south a few miles. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.23,0:35:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经因为内脏堵住了空气过滤器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already hit a full stop because of an air filter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.55,0:35:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而止步了一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}compromised by innards.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.33,0:35:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似情况会再次发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.57,0:35:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就再用水管收拾它们一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll hit them with the hose.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.37,0:35:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,水箱里没水了 亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tank is empty, Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.98,0:35:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们把油门踩到底…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we floor it…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.94,0:35:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是会撞上行尸 它们还是会拖慢我们的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still hit them, they still slow us down,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.95,0:35:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我们就会被困住\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then they stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.80,0:35:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说要直穿过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying we just go straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.41,0:35:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路就是直穿过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way the road goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.10,0:35:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚伯拉罕 - 我们可以穿过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Abraham! - We can get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.12,0:35:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.78,0:35:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那意味着我们不能往南走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means we are not going south,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.62,0:35:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能绕路 也不能回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}going around, or going back!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.61,0:35:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.03,0:35:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.14,0:36:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.72,0:36:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么 住手 - 放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? Stop. - Let go of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.62,0:36:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.05,0:36:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你会的 - 快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, you are. - Hey, hey, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.74,0:36:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚开 - 你完了 你完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out. - Hey, you are done! You're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.88,0:36:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 别这样 - 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do not! Do not! - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.88,0:36:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过了 别碰我 别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, you do not touch me! You do not touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.26,0:36:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.07,0:36:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.04,0:36:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.86,0:36:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.80,0:36:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撒谎了 我不是科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied. I'm not a scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.49,0:36:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道要如何阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.66,0:36:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.17,0:37:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是科学家啊 我见识过你做的事情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a scientist. I've seen the things that you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.82,0:37:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是知道一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know things.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.05,0:37:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是知道一些东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just… "Know things"?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.38,0:37:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我比大多数人聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm smarter than most people,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.09,0:37:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我很擅长撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm a very good liar,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.25,0:37:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我需要去华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know I needed to get to DC.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.49,0:37:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.76,0:37:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我相信在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I do believe that locale.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.21,0:37:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存的可能性最大\N{\fnArial\fs30}holds the strongest possibility for survival,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.06,0:37:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我想要生存下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wanted to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.43,0:37:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能骗一些人带我去 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I could cheat some people into taking me there, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.24,0:37:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会对他们说 我这也是在帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just reasoned that I'd be doin' them a solid, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.54,0:37:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到休斯顿的危险环境和现状\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering the perilous state of the city of Houston, the state of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.48,0:38:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了帮你走到这里 很多人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People died trying to get you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.33,0:38:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware of that…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.88,0:38:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂芬妮 沃伦 帕姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stephanie, Warren, Pam,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.09,0:38:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯 罗杰 乔塞亚 德克和约瑟芬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rex, Roger, Josiah, Dirk, and Josephine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.32,0:38:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.12,0:38:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离得越近 我越害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I lost my nerve as we grew closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.98,0:38:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是个懦夫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I am a coward…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.95,0:38:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一想到抵达目的地后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the reality of getting to our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.67,0:38:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就必须揭示真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}and disclosing the truth of the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.94,0:38:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我非常恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}became some truly frightening shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.52,0:38:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想方设法减慢我们的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took it upon myself to slow our roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.34,0:38:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽时间来进行安排 这样等我们到了以后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find time to finesse things so then when we got there…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.12,0:38:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.88,0:38:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于意识到我别无选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fully realize there are no longer any agreeable options.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.98,0:38:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样我都是死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was screwed either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.95,0:39:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还撒谎说布鲁克斯·埃利斯喜欢我的发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also lied about T. Brooks Ellis liking my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.17,0:39:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识布鲁克斯·埃利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know T. Brooks Ellis.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.68,0:39:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我读过他的一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did read one of his books,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.72,0:39:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来不像那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he seemed like the type of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.93,0:39:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,会介意田纳西大礼帽长发的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wouldn't blink twice at a Tennessee Top Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.12,0:39:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.39,0:39:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你们聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am smarter than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.01,0:39:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也许想把我丢在这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you may want to leave me here…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.38,0:39:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! Hey! - Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.01,0:39:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.23,0:39:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.99,0:39:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.80,0:39:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.32,0:39:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.36,0:40:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 尤金 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Eugene, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.61,0:40:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.42,0:40:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.64,0:40:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.90,0:40:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.45,0:41:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.82,0:41:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.13,0:41:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.86,0:41:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了 干掉它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's them. Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.94,0:41:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them. Get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.41,0:41:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.67,0:41:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.51,0:41:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得它们的速度变快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think… I think they're getting faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.00,0:41:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.45,0:41:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.43,0:41:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.62,0:41:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能走 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't leave! - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.99,0:42:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身负着一项非常重要的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a very important mission.
